WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The most useful ideas start as conversations that somebody cared enough to remember.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:39.000
A small team moves faster when the decision and the discussion stay attached to the work.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Trust grows when the source is visible and a human still owns the final call.
